@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 中文翻译为英语
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/translation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Spring AI 让构建企业级 AI 应用变得简单。",
  "source": "ZH",
  "target": "EN",
  "glossary": [
    {"source": "Spring AI", "target": "Spring AI"}
  ]
}

### 英语翻译为日语，并使用术语表
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/translation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The Spring AI framework supports structured output.",
  "source": "EN",
  "target": "JA",
  "glossary": [
    {"source": "Spring AI", "target": "Spring AI"},
    {"source": "structured output", "target": "構造化出力"}
  ]
}

### 不带术语表的翻译
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/translation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello world",
  "source": "EN",
  "target": "ZH"
}

### 非法语言返回中文 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/translation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello",
  "source": "EN",
  "target": "XX"
}

### 源语言与目标语言相同返回中文 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/translation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello",
  "source": "EN",
  "target": "EN"
}
